{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the edge of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an engineer on the last Arctic expedition, sent to reestablish contact with a research station lost amid the icy storms. The only way to reach it is by an old tracked vehicle, creaking across the dead ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every kilometer, reality and common sense begin to crack at the seams. Radio interference turns into whispers. Strange silhouettes appear on the horizon. The temperature drops, and time seems to stand still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- PSX ambience<br>- Creepy storyline<br>- The vibe of hopelessness<br>- Cthulhu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features point-and-click mechanics, where you must interact with the surrounding world to complete missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something ancient has awakened beneath the ice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And it is waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940290?t=1768932628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940290?t=1768932628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940290/54278c02d0867267afec155082e8a17e9de35074/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768932628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940290/54278c02d0867267afec155082e8a17e9de35074/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768932628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"extreme violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the edge of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an engineer on the last Arctic expedition, sent to reestablish contact with a research station lost amid the icy storms. The only way to reach it is by an old tracked vehicle, creaking across the dead ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with every kilometer, reality and common sense begin to crack at the seams. Radio interference turns into whispers. Strange silhouettes appear on the horizon. The temperature drops, and time seems to stand still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- PSX ambience<br>- Creepy storyline<br>- The vibe of hopelessness<br>- Cthulhu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features point-and-click mechanics, where you must interact with the surrounding world to complete missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something ancient has awakened beneath the ice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And it is waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ted Zufle"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940290/ad21e1bbd5d40c01808938045679e1d738536485/header.jpg?t=1768932628","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"ARCTIC CTHULHU","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS: